ple, he is having endless trouble communicating with humans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He works as a night janitor at \"Pikari Cleaning\" along with Kamata (a homosexual cross-dresser who has an unrequited crush on him) and Saruwatari (a friendly guy who looks a bit like a monkey)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite sports: boxing, rugby, ice hockey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite actress: Ashikawa Izumi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4980"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca78a606e8fd69f38b6e536239489886ed4da3563ad84ad1678d04de6b324a1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0d00cfa18346fd38727c5454a13dd614b0e95ad2e7111398bde584ce5110e82.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4985","characterName":"壇ノ崎　ラミア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4985"},"originalCharacterName":"壇ノ崎　ラミア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daughter in a vampire family, she is Camilla's older twin sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lamia is a beautiful girl with an innocent personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has the power to act, she is popular and friendly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: tracking the achievements of idols and admiring them, collecting small toy that are sold with food."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her type of man: a guy who is great to be around."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d251bb8dc8762477b04f289d33fd2076858577ade0ab5e574e00471d374485a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af4bd8f677e4b5d34078a39394371e1ad34307116ac4399f1bf7b5793e280ee5.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4986","characterName":"壇ノ崎　カーミラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4986"},"originalCharacterName":"壇ノ崎　カーミラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daughter of a vampire family, she is Lamia's younger twin sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being calm and reassuring, Camilla is unrivaled in cruelty. She is brilliant, she has both brains and beauty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Camilla is trusted to take care of the family. But because she is very independent and does everything alone, most of the time her family members don't know where she is or what she is doing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Camilla owns a laptop which she uses mainly for asset management. So far she has been doing it without any incidents. Contrary to her mature expression on her face, she has enough nerves to pull off various crimes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Things that interest her: Psychology, her computer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Things she always wanted to see: A tornado."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interests: psychology, computer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"What she'd like to see: A tornado"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4986"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be638ef534171f2f6052e46e966aed6a611f7ba8d350ade158e0ea23c688b2dc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b7769258ae48d4c27e06cb55a794a24923cbd14e414993c4c984d07100da74f.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4987","characterName":"壇ノ崎 ジルド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4987"},"originalCharacterName":"壇ノ崎 ジルド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Second son of a vampire family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Jilld's body is weak and sickly, so he stays indoor most of the time. Because he doesn't like disputes, he wants to coexist with humans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a good, serious but unreasonable, young man who tends to conflict with family members here and there, partly due to him going through a rebellious phase."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His older brother Vlad often hits him for being a hikikomori. While seeking for somebody who could understand him, he met Fuuka in the hospital."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite game genres: Role-Playing, Simulation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: Hamburger (with cheese), corn pottage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5ad628958ed08d71bcde0bc653d9f57b85aa5d9538c28484b4a46b669b949c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2a319761d58e4e46f87f60285b2a7a09d5760029b9efa7aab34baaf3662f3bf.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4988","characterName":"霜鳥　冬香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4988"},"originalCharacterName":"霜鳥　冬香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fuuka is an unfortunate girl who had closed her heart from the world due to suffering from a heavy disease and a complicated domestic environment. She finds her pleasure only in reading."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her father is a single parent, and he is currently working abroad. She is now being hospitalized in the Umegaoka Hospital, during her staying she had built a good relationship with nurse Fujimaru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After encountering Jilld she started to regain the energy to live little by little..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favourite Book: The Neverending Story"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A place she'd like to visit: A place in the wild where penguins live."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4988"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7ffdc9eced274fa85928c4f981469f5067df4c1cf7b58da606093c5f29f484e0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87a0da06ea5a92cc622fc047e71cbfbf84fd5cbf439ddcc66586921573e9900a.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4989","characterName":"藤丸　りえ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4989"},"originalCharacterName":"藤丸　りえ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rie is a nurse in the Umegaoka Memorial General Hospital. She is an earnest, gentle and hardworking nurse without ambitions. Rie is in charge of taking care of Fuyuka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lately she had been hearing some strange stories from her colleagues about what is going on in the hospital."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special Skills: Handicraft, Electone (?)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dreams for the future: wants to have three children, the eldest will be a girl, the second...~and so on and so forth~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4989"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/54001887eec4704907341151b4ed800b1070c0f3d81aee46839748ac4c84d013.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/054290622609fd08c19c78af840fcf69ca026ab017bc29970733a44002328b6f.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4990","characterName":"古賀　ひばり","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4990"},"originalCharacterName":"古賀　ひばり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious girl. Seems to be involved somehow in the series of incidents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite Book: Une Vie ((lit. A Woman's Life) by Maupassant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The type of guys she hates: Men who only talk about theirselves."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4990"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/800ad3fd6d2679b4fd19ce96e16fe0da7e0f922eecb60b57468c534b4fce0896.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2de1d4404726e0fdd16011b22989ed4d40e5927dba9d19d2b041e40b842b1d4b.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4991","characterName":"東海林　希美子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4991"},"originalCharacterName":"東海林　希美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A nurse at Umegaoka Memorial General Hospital, Fujimaru Rie's colleague. Unlike her Kimiko is not as passionate for her work as she only tries to make a living from it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first glance, she looks like one who often goes places, but in reality she spends most of her holidays watching TV at home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: Ethnic food, spicy food in general."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Things she wants to do: Scuba diving, round-the-world trip."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4991"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7fd5c52ac1346680cd96dc4c269e9826d805bef21a14c477b00d5e568ef810a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c75879383b2149baa30a08c1d480e83f198ec839117c5bdbdae43f1a6ea5d1b.webp","width":143,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2019","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3871","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2019","name":"RISUSOFT","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:39872:3871","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2019","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2019","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2019","name":"RISUSOFT","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","re